  (text "AHCT TX buffer: 3.3 V TTL-compatible inputs, 5 V bus output, active-high enable default low.\nLVC RX buffer: powered at 3.3 V with a 5.5 V-tolerant input. Receive echo is visible during transmit.\nDirection timing, first/last byte, powered-off servo behaviour and 1 Mbps edges require the actual harness bench test."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
