  (text "LEG=Serial1 pins 0/1, UPPER=Serial2 pins 7/8, LEFT=Serial3 pins 15/14, RIGHT=Serial4 pins 16/17.\nSTM/STS and older SCS framing is firmware work; these buffers do not translate protocols.\nExternal ESD device selection and bus pull-up, if the actual servos require one, remain bench decisions."
